{'symbol': 'RSG', 'date': '2023-03-28 09:04:00', 'title': "REPUBLIC SERVICES RANKS 15TH ON BARRON'S 2023 100 MOST SUSTAINABLE COMPANIES LIST", 'text': "THIS MARKS THE COMPANY'S FIFTH TIME ON BARRON'S PRESTIGIOUS LIST PHOENIX , MARCH 28, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REPUBLIC SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: RSG), A LEADER IN THE ENVIRONMENTAL SERVICES INDUSTRY, RANKS 15TH ON BARRON'S 2023 LIST OF THE 100 MOST SUSTAINABLE U.S. COMPANIES. THIS IS THE FIFTH TIME THE COMPANY HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED ON BARRON'S LIST, WHICH RANKS COMPANIES ACROSS 230 ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) PERFORMANCE METRICS."}